ling body under control. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She knows that her own life is now on the gambling table, and the winner takes all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And she has no choice but to go all-in."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
